# Test: web BGP decode tool returns decoded output in web-only mode
# VALIDATES: AC-8 -- BGP Decode with valid UPDATE hex renders decoded attributes
# PREVENTS: decode tool broken because of wrong dispatch key or missing in-process path

option=env:var=ze.config.dir:value=.
option=timeout:value=20s

tmpfs=decode-hex.form:encoding=base64:terminator=EOF_HEX
aGV4PUZGRkZGRkZGRkZGRkZGRkZGRkZGRkZGRkZGRkZGRkZGMDAyRjAyMDAwMDAwMTg0MDAxMDEwMDQwMDIwMDQwMDMwNDY1MDE2NTAxNDAwNTA0MDAwMDAwNjQwMDE4YWMxMDAxMDA=
EOF_HEX

# Web-only mode requires blob storage: the silent bare-`--web` web-only fallback
# was removed in 7323da866 (add --web-only flag), so seed storage with `ze init`,
# then start the standalone web UI. This still exercises the in-process BGP
# decode path with no daemon, exactly as AC-8 intends.
#
# TWO commands, not one wrapper script, and that is the fix for this test's CI
# failure. As a single `sh` wrapper the runner could not tell `ze init` from the
# daemon, so the 15s http=wait budget had to cover BOTH -- an interactive `ze
# init` that bcrypt-hashes a password, then a second multi-megabyte process
# start. On the maintainer's machine that fits easily; on the 4-vCPU CI runner it
# did not, and every run reported "connection refused (timeout 15s)" as though
# the server were misconfigured. Split, `ze init` is a quick-exit ze subcommand
# (isQuickExitZeCommand, internal/test/runner/runner_exec_util.go) which the
# runner AWAITS to completion -- a real condition, not a share of a polling
# budget -- so the http wait now covers only the daemon start.
#
# The wrapper also ran `ze init >/dev/null 2>&1` under `set -e`: a failing init
# exited the script silently and surfaced only as the refused connection above.
# Run directly with `:exit=0`, its exit code is asserted per command
# (RunCommand.ExitCode, internal/test/runner/record.go) -- the file-level
# `expect=exit:code=` would NOT cover it, since that only ever reaches the last
# quick-exit ze command.
stdin=init-answers:terminator=EOF_INIT
admin
secret123
127.0.0.1
2222

EOF_INIT

cmd=foreground:seq=1:exec=ze init:stdin=init-answers:exit=0
cmd=foreground:seq=2:exec=ze start --web $PORT2 --web-only --insecure-web:timeout=20s

http=wait:seq=1:url=https://127.0.0.1:$PORT2/show/:status=200:insecure-tls=true:timeout=15s
http=post:seq=2:url=https://127.0.0.1:$PORT2/show/tools/bgp-decode/:status=200:sendfile=decode-hex.form:content-type=application/x-www-form-urlencoded:insecure-tls=true:contains=origin
